    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0000",
      "start": 1.74,
      "end": 19.12,
      "text": "You have cancer.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0001",
      "start": 20.46,
      "end": 25.46,
      "text": "Sadly, about 40% of us will hear those three words within our lifetime.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0002",
      "start": 25.46,
      "end": 28.46,
      "text": "And half will not survive.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0003",
      "start": 28.46,
      "end": 32.46,
      "text": "This means that two out of five of your closest friends and relatives",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0004",
      "start": 32.46,
      "end": 36.46,
      "text": "will be diagnosed with some form of cancer, and one will die.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0005",
      "start": 36.46,
      "end": 40.29,
      "text": "Beyond the physical hardships,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0006",
      "start": 40.29,
      "end": 43.29,
      "text": "roughly one-third of cancer survivors here in the U.S.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0007",
      "start": 43.29,
      "end": 45.29,
      "text": "will go into debt from treatment,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.733,
      "compression_ratio": 1.542
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0008",
      "start": 45.29,
      "end": 49.77,
      "text": "and they're at least two and a half times more likely to declare bankruptcy than those",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.543
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0009",
      "start": 49.77,
      "end": 51.85,
      "text": "without cancer.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.543
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0010",
      "start": 51.85,
      "end": 60.05,
      "text": "This disease is pervasive, it's emotionally draining, and for many, financially destructive.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.543
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0011",
      "start": 60.05,
      "end": 64.27,
      "text": "But a cancer diagnosis doesn't have to be a death sentence.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.543
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0012",
      "start": 64.27,
      "end": 69.37,
      "text": "Finding cancer early, closer to its genesis, is one of the critical factors to improving",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.543
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0013",
      "start": 69.37,
      "end": 75.85,
      "text": "treatment options, reducing its emotional impact, and minimizing financial burdens.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.118,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008,
      "compression_ratio": 1.607
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0014",
      "start": 75.85,
      "end": 81.33,
      "text": "Most importantly, finding cancer early, which is one of the primary aims of my research,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.118,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008,
      "compression_ratio": 1.607
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0015",
      "start": 81.33,
      "end": 84.25,
      "text": "greatly enhances your odds of survival.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.118,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008,
      "compression_ratio": 1.607
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0016",
      "start": 84.25,
      "end": 88.59,
      "text": "If we just look at the case of breast cancer, for example, we find that those who are diagnosed",
      "avg_logprob": -0.118,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008,
      "compression_ratio": 1.607
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0017",
      "start": 88.59,
      "end": 95.05,
      "text": "and treated at stage one have a five-year survival rate of nearly 100 percent, odds",
      "avg_logprob": -0.118,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008,
      "compression_ratio": 1.607
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0018",
      "start": 95.05,
      "end": 100.15,
      "text": "that decreased to just 22% if treated at stage 4.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.561
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0019",
      "start": 100.15,
      "end": 106.09,
      "text": "And similar trends are found for colorectal and ovarian cancer.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.561
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0020",
      "start": 106.09,
      "end": 115.64,
      "text": "Now we're all aware that an early diagnosis that is accurate is critical for survival.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.561
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0021",
      "start": 115.64,
      "end": 121.6,
      "text": "The problem is that many cancer diagnostic tools are invasive, costly, often inaccurate",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.561
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0022",
      "start": 121.6,
      "end": 126.76,
      "text": "and they can take an agonizing amount of time to get the results back.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.561
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0023",
      "start": 126.76,
      "end": 132.28,
      "text": "Even worse, when it comes to some forms of cancer such as ovarian, liver, or pancreatic",
      "avg_logprob": -0.139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.095,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0024",
      "start": 132.28,
      "end": 138.7,
      "text": "cancer, good screening methods simply don't exist, meaning that often people wait until",
      "avg_logprob": -0.139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.095,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0025",
      "start": 138.7,
      "end": 146.06,
      "text": "physical symptoms surface, which are themselves already indicators of late stage progression.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.095,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0026",
      "start": 146.06,
      "end": 150.52,
      "text": "Like a tornado strike in an area without an early warning system, there is no alarm",
      "avg_logprob": -0.139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.095,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0027",
      "start": 150.52,
      "end": 156.08,
      "text": "to warn before the danger is already at your doorstep, when your odds of survival",
      "avg_logprob": -0.139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.095,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0028",
      "start": 156.08,
      "end": 163.65,
      "text": "are greatly reduced. Having the convenience and accessibility of regular screening options",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.096,
      "compression_ratio": 1.632
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0029",
      "start": 163.65,
      "end": 169.65,
      "text": "that are affordable, non-invasive, and could provide results much sooner would provide us",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.096,
      "compression_ratio": 1.632
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0030",
      "start": 169.65,
      "end": 176.25,
      "text": "with a formidable weapon in the fight against cancer. An early warning would allow us to",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.096,
      "compression_ratio": 1.632
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0031",
      "start": 176.25,
      "end": 180.77,
      "text": "get out ahead of the disease instead of merely following in its relentless wake. And this",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.096,
      "compression_ratio": 1.632
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0032",
      "start": 180.77,
      "end": 184.97,
      "text": "is exactly what I've been doing. For the past three years, I've been developing",
      "avg_logprob": -0.123,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.096,
      "compression_ratio": 1.632
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0033",
      "start": 184.97,
      "end": 191.09,
      "text": "technologies that could ultimately aid clinicians with rapid early stage cancer diagnostics.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043,
      "compression_ratio": 1.564
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0034",
      "start": 191.09,
      "end": 199.21,
      "text": "And I've been fueled by a deep scientific curiosity and a passion to change these statistics.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043,
      "compression_ratio": 1.564
    },
    {
