      "start": 199.21,
      "end": 205.49,
      "text": "Last year, however, this fight became much more personal when my wife was diagnosed with",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043,
      "compression_ratio": 1.564
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0036",
      "start": 205.49,
      "end": 212.01,
      "text": "breast cancer. It was an experience that added a strong and unexpected emotional dimension",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043,
      "compression_ratio": 1.564
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0037",
      "start": 212.01,
      "end": 219.69,
      "text": "these efforts. I know firsthand how life-altering treatment can be. And I'm",
      "avg_logprob": -0.212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.086,
      "compression_ratio": 1.565
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--e980fb#0038",
      "start": 219.69,
      "end": 224.81,
      "text": "keenly aware of the emotional havoc that cancer can wreak on a family, which",
      "avg_logprob": -0.212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.086,
